    'That means the PHP scan, the browser pass, the Inspect preview and the overlay, so no surface reports what another one skips. The common consent banners, OneTrust, Cookiebot, Ketch and the rest, are always excluded. Add anything else on the page you do not control, a chat widget for instance.' => 'That means the PHP scan, the browser pass, the Inspect preview and the overlay, so no surface reports what another one skips. The common consent banners, OneTrust, Cookiebot, Ketch and the rest, are always excluded. Add anything else on the page you do not control, a chat widget for instance.',
