    'The accessibility score for {label} dropped {drop} points, from {from} to {to}.' => 'The accessibility score for {label} dropped {drop} points, from {from} to {to}.',
    'The API rejected the request. Check the key and try again.' => 'The API rejected the request. Check the key and try again.',
    'The asset library has not been audited yet.' => 'The asset library has not been audited yet.',
    'The automated conformance suggestions below come from the scan of {date}. Fixing a page does not change them until it is scanned again.' => 'The automated conformance suggestions below come from the scan of {date}. Fixing a page does not change them until it is scanned again.',
    'The completed document is called an ACR (Accessibility Conformance Report). This editor produces one against WCAG 2.2 Level A and AA.' => 'The completed document is called an ACR (Accessibility Conformance Report). This editor produces one against WCAG 2.2 Level A and AA.',
    'The conformance level to report against. AA is required by most accessibility regulations (EU, UK, US).' => 'The conformance level to report against. AA is required by most accessibility regulations (EU, UK, US).',
    'The connection check confirms delivery works.' => 'The connection check confirms delivery works.',
    'The Console Commands page of the plugin documentation has ready-made daily, weekly, monthly, and custom-day examples, plus prune and asset-sweep schedules.' => 'The Console Commands page of the plugin documentation has ready-made daily, weekly, monthly, and custom-day examples, plus prune and asset-sweep schedules.',
    'The decoupled frontend overlay is not enabled.' => 'The decoupled frontend overlay is not enabled.',
    'The documentation covers most questions. For anything it does not (installation, configuration, scanning errors, or false positives) contact the plugin author directly.' => 'The documentation covers most questions. For anything it does not (installation, configuration, scanning errors, or false positives) contact the plugin author directly.',
    'The draft came back empty. Try again, or write the remark yourself.' => 'The draft came back empty. Try again, or write the remark yourself.',
    'The dummy options send sample content through the same formatting as a real alert, so you can see how each one lands in the inbox or the channel. Dummy subjects carry a "[Test]" prefix so nobody mistakes one for a live regression. "Both together" mirrors a scan that trips both triggers at once: they arrive as two separate messages.' => 'The dummy options send sample content through the same formatting as a real alert, so you can see how each one lands in the inbox or the channel. Dummy subjects carry a "[Test]" prefix so nobody mistakes one for a live regression. "Both together" mirrors a scan that trips both triggers at once: they arrive as two separate messages.',
    'The evaluation covered the following pages and screens:' => 'The evaluation covered the following pages and screens:',
    'The evaluation period cannot end before it starts.' => 'The evaluation period cannot end before it starts.',
    'The evaluation used:' => 'The evaluation used:',
    'The field handle used to store alt text on assets. Defaults to Craft\'s built-in "alt" field. Change this if your assets use a custom plain text field for alt text. The asset audit and AI generation both read and write this field.' => 'The field handle used to store alt text on assets. Defaults to Craft\'s built-in "alt" field. Change this if your assets use a custom plain text field for alt text. The asset audit and AI generation both read and write this field.',
    'The full panel opens when the badge is clicked. With this off it opens by itself as soon as a scan finds something, which is what you want while you are working on a page and not what you want the rest of the time.' => 'The full panel opens when the badge is clicked. With this off it opens by itself as soon as a scan finds something, which is what you want while you are working on a page and not what you want the rest of the time.',
    'The issues list works fine at this size, but the live preview and highlighting need more room. For the full report, use a wider screen.' => 'The issues list works fine at this size, but the live preview and highlighting need more room. For the full report, use a wider screen.',
