    'The person or team who answers accessibility problems.' => 'The person or team who answers accessibility problems.',
    'The PHP scan, the browser pass and the overlay all honour them. One per line, for example <code>^checkout</code>, <code>print$</code> or <code>^admin/</code>. The homepage is <code>^$</code>. A row left blank matches nothing.' => 'The PHP scan, the browser pass and the overlay all honour them. One per line, for example <code>^checkout</code>, <code>print$</code> or <code>^admin/</code>. The homepage is <code>^$</code>. A row left blank matches nothing.',
