    'The reading level the Readability preview marks hard sentences against.' => 'The reading level the Readability preview marks hard sentences against.',
    'The same markup repeats {n} times on this page. Answering here answers all of them.' => 'The same markup repeats {n} times on this page. Answering here answers all of them.',
    'The scanner only ever sets the conformance level. Add a remark to each row yourself, explaining how the product meets the criterion or where the gap is.' => 'The scanner only ever sets the conformance level. Add a remark to each row yourself, explaining how the product meets the criterion or where the gap is.',
    'The statement must say how it was prepared and when it was last reviewed.' => 'The statement must say how it was prepared and when it was last reviewed.',
    'The stylesheet rule "{selector}" removes the keyboard focus outline, and no other rule draws anything in its place. It applies to {n, plural, =1{# focusable element} other{# focusable elements}} on this page.' => 'The stylesheet rule "{selector}" removes the keyboard focus outline, and no other rule draws anything in its place. It applies to {n, plural, =1{# focusable element} other{# focusable elements}} on this page.',
    'The text, sentence by sentence' => 'The text, sentence by sentence',
    'The three shortfall categories are still worth using: they read very differently to somebody deciding whether you are taking this seriously.' => 'The three shortfall categories are still worth using: they read very differently to somebody deciding whether you are taking this seriously.',
    'The wait gives late-rendering JavaScript time to finish, and it is paid on every pass, twice per page for desktop and mobile. On a large site it is one of the biggest levers on how long a scan takes. Plenty of sites are fine at 500. Set 0 to skip it, or raise it if client-rendered content is being missed.' => 'The wait gives late-rendering JavaScript time to finish, and it is paid on every pass, twice per page for desktop and mobile. On a large site it is one of the biggest levers on how long a scan takes. Plenty of sites are fine at 500. Set 0 to skip it, or raise it if client-rendered content is being missed.',
    'The website was assessed by {organisation}, using a combination of automated testing and manual review.' => 'The website was assessed by {organisation}, using a combination of automated testing and manual review.',
    'The website was evaluated by {evaluator}.' => 'The website was evaluated by {evaluator}.',
    'There are failing criteria this statement does not mention. A published statement that omits a known failure is worse than no statement: see Non-accessible content below.' => 'There are failing criteria this statement does not mention. A published statement that omits a known failure is worse than no statement: see Non-accessible content below.',
