    'This is an unofficial, community-created plugin. It runs axe-core, unmodified, on the rendered page and adds its own checks for what axe-core cannot see, such as markup the browser repairs and hover and focus colours. It is not officially affiliated with the W3C, Deque Systems, or ITI (VPAT®).' => 'This is an unofficial, community-created plugin. It runs axe-core, unmodified, on the rendered page and adds its own checks for what axe-core cannot see, such as markup the browser repairs and hover and focus colours. It is not officially affiliated with the W3C, Deque Systems, or ITI (VPAT®).',
    'This is being overridden by the `{setting}` config setting.' => 'This is being overridden by the `{setting}` config setting.',
    'This is independent of the Frontend Overlay switch under General, which only controls injection on pages Craft renders itself. Turn this on when the front end is served by something else and needs to load the overlay for itself.' => 'This is independent of the Frontend Overlay switch under General, which only controls injection on pages Craft renders itself. Turn this on when the front end is served by something else and needs to load the overlay for itself.',
    'This is the page you publish on the site telling the public how accessible it is and who to contact. In the EU and the UK, publishing one is a legal obligation.' => 'This is the page you publish on the site telling the public how accessible it is and who to contact. In the EU and the UK, publishing one is a legal obligation.',
